;- Hey guys i'm "VLADNESAS" from the philippines, creator
;- of cyborg superman, this is my first and last mugen 
;- character... i didn't think making one would be so tideous
;- and time consuming.. i created cyborg superman because i'm
;- surprised that after so many characters have been created for   
;- mugen no one has thought of making a decent cyborg superman, 
;- "superman Remix" has been released since 2006, someone should.
;- have thought of it then. Superman is such an icon and he deserves 
;- an intresting foe or he should be echoed in a more interesting
;- manner than just bizzarro... 
;- 
;-
;-
;- since this is my first character, it took me a while to get the
;- hang of using fighter factory and coding... the template I used
;- for cyborg superman is "Superman Remix", so thanks to you guys
;- for making such an awesome character that it inspired me to make
;- a "cyber" echo of your creation. for the frankensprites i used
;- "superman remix", Buyog's "Bizarro", "tron bonne", "captain commando"
;- 
;- 
;-
;- for the idea of making this character, i first did some research of
;- cyborg superman (hank henshaw) and my basic knowledge being a superman fan myself.
;- A cyborg clone of superman has been created by lex luthor in cartoons,
;- another version is hank henshaw, clone of superman genes mixed with  
;- cybernetic parts.. he has the abilities of superman and can control
;- mechanical devices..  so i mixed those two together and added things
;- that what i think a cyborg superman should have... 
;- i also added that he can use blodia to do a punch and drill since he's
;- mechanical, cyborg superman should be able to control him.  he can also
;- use sentinel and cyber akuma as his helpers.
;-
;- i tried making extra pallettes for him but i was having color problems with the
;- other sprites, so as now theres only one pallette. 
;- 
;-
;- i hope you enjoy using this character... incase you want to give upgrades 
;- you may do so, but tell me first so that i could give my inputs and opinions as well
;- 
